  "body": "Move-in Ready! Imagine Christmas Day champagne in hand, looking out over the Hauraki Gulf! Spend the rest of the holidays locking in pool plans and deciding how to use the magnificent space. Superb value for what's on offer; must be viewed.\r\n\r\nPositioned in a quiet, peaceful position in one of Glendowie's most sought-after crescents, this expansive family residence features a wonderful, seamless flow that delivers the ultimate combination of space, style, and coastal living.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n* Generous Accommodation: Four spacious bedrooms, complemented by a large dedicated study-ideal for working from home or a teenage retreat (staged as a bedroom on the lower level)\r\n* Versatile Living: Two distinct living areas providing ample room for family relaxation and entertaining, downstairs complete with a convenient kitchenette. The exterior on the lower level is masonry block, providing peace of mind.\r\n* Breathtaking Views: Enjoy serene water views across Tahuna Torea and out to the Hauraki Gulf from the lounge, kitchen, dining area, and the sunny elevated balcony.\r\n* Outdoor Potential: Wonderful indoor-outdoor flow across both levels, with ample backyard space offering exciting potential for a pool (exisiting plans)\r\n* Exceptional Parking: Plenty of secure off-street parking for all the \"toys\"- boats, jet skis, or extra vehicles.\r\n* School Zones & Education: Zoned for Glendowie Primary and Glendowie College, with Sacred Heart College also within easy walking distance.\r\n* Offering heaps of internal space and a lifestyle of absolute convenience close to local reserves, beaches, and amenities, this is a rare opportunity to secure a premier property in a tightly held neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange a viewing!",
